# Production build values. Vite loads .env first and then .env.production over
# the top of it, so this file only needs the keys whose *dev* value would be
# wrong in a deployed bundle.
#
# It exists because there is exactly one of those and it is fatal: VITE_ENGINE_URL
# is the API base, it is read at BUILD time, and a local `npm run build` would
# otherwise bake `http://localhost:8787` into the bundle we upload. That fails
# silently on most pages (they degrade to no data) and takes /pricing down
# outright, because its loader throws when the call does not return JSON.
#
# Everything here is public by definition: it ships inside the client bundle.
# Real secrets belong in server/.env and never carry the VITE_ prefix.


VITE_ENGINE_URL=https://tempo-chess-api-384112442354.europe-west1.run.app
VITE_API_URL=https://tempo-chess-api-384112442354.europe-west1.run.app
